Dani Eder wrote: <If we put our minds to it...> and <I am merely showing that
given sufficient utilization of the energy the Sun puts through the Earth's
neighborhood, you get a physically open system on time scales that are pretty
short.  So, I conclude that those who claim the Earth is a 'closed system'
